              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "may be affected.",
              "pdf_page": 925,
              "printed_page": 843,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Large-breed dogs more commonly have pleural effusion first, and",
