          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Intravenous fluid administration",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "for support.",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Administer oxygen and treat",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "for shock—when indicated.",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Anesthesia— requires adequate ventilatory support;",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "carefully monitor patient.",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Surgical removal of the involved lobe(s)—only effective treatment; do not untwist lobe and attempt to salvage—may lead to recurrence or necrosis; in situ ligation of the vessels or clamping with noncrushing forceps has been advocated to avoid reperfusion problems such as acidosis; consider use of surgical stapling device; closely inspect remaining thoracic",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "structures for any abnormalities; perform culture and pathologic examination of excised",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "specimen.",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "level": 0,
          "text": "Post surgery—monitoring; supportive care; tube drainage. Torsion of a second lung lobe may occur.",
          "pdf_page": 925,
          "printed_page": 843,
          "column": 3
        }
      ],
